  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed two-storey side extension, by virtue of its bulk, gable crown roof design and close proximity to the shared boundary with No. 258 Willow Road, would result in an overlydominant and unneighbourly form of development which would result in an unacceptable loss of  outlook for the neighbouring occupiers and would create a heightened sense of enclosure. The proposal therefore fails to meet the requirements of Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD10, DMD11 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
